OL,3,GNEWSADumped trailer carrying 40 tonnes
OL,4,Aof waste catches fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trailer carrying 40 tonnes of
OL,7,Fconstruction and household waste has
OL,8,Fcaught fire, two weeks after it was
OL,9,Ffound illegally dumped beside the A41
OL,10,Fin Shropshire.
OL,12,FThe fire broke out just before midnight
OL,13,Fon Sunday and the road between Tern
OL,14,FHill and Forton was closed while
OL,15,Ffirefighters dealt with the incident.
OL,17,FShropshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,18,Fits crews had to work in "challenging
OL,19,Fconditions due to the significant
OL,20,Famount of smoke being produced and the
OL,21,Fpotential instability of the trailer".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
