OL,3,GNEWSADumped trailer carrying 40 tonnes
OL,4,Aof waste catches fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews had to cut away the side wall to
OL,7,Fgain better access and found the
OL,8,Ftrailer was "tightly packed with waste
OL,9,Ffrom front to back and from floor to
OL,10,Froof," it added.
